      "v.chapel.tip": "Every year on 24 August, the cheeses from the surrounding mountain pastures are blessed here during a service — a genuine local tradition that almost no visitor ever sees.",
      "v.printse.kicker": "Through the valley",
      "v.printse.em": "Printse",
      "v.printse.p1": "The river that runs through Siviez is the Printse. It gathers the meltwater of the high peaks, fills the Lac de Cleuson, and then tumbles down the valley that carries its name — the Vallée de la Printze.",
      "v.printse.p2": "Along its banks near the village you'll find a barefoot path — a 2.4-kilometre loop over grass, stones and cool water, made for lazy summer mornings — and a family picnic area with a barbecue.",
      "v.printse.tip": "In high summer the cows graze freely on the slopes beside the water. Bring a picnic, dip your feet, and let the afternoon go by to the sound of cowbells.",
      "v.getting.kicker": "Getting there",
      "v.eat.kicker": "Eat & drink",
      "v.eat.title": "Where to eat in Siviez",
      "v.eat.lead": "Two places, both a short walk apart. One is in the very building of our apartment; the other guards the entrance to the village.",
      "v.eat.caroline.badge": "In our building",
