      "v.eat.caroline.where": "Rosablanche building · at the foot of the slopes",
      "v.eat.caroline.body": "Right in the Rosablanche building — the same block as our apartment. A sunny terrace over the valley and the Lac de Cleuson, a seasonal menu of burgers, salads, soups and grilled meats, and breakfast to start the day. In winter, the Yeti Bar keeps things going after the last run.",
      "v.eat.caroline.insider": "It also works as the village bakery: order your bread and croissants the evening before and pick them up fresh in the morning — a lift ride from bed.",
      "v.eat.caroline.p1": "Terrace",
