      "v.eat.bergers.body": "An alpine-atmosphere restaurant at the entrance to Siviez, serving the real thing: open-hearth grills, cheese dishes and other Valais specialities, with local products at the heart of it all. In both summer and winter you can eat out on the sun-drenched terrace.",
      "v.eat.bergers.insider": "Also known locally as \"Chez Benzine\" — a proper mountain grill where the fire does the work.",
