      "v.getting.car.body": "About 40 minutes up from Sion, along winding mountain roads through Haute-Nendaz to the very end of the valley. Large parking is available in the village.",
      "v.getting.transport.title": "By public transport",
      "v.getting.transport.body": "Train to Sion, then the postbus up to Haute-Nendaz, and on to Siviez. A scenic way to arrive, with no mountain driving.",
      "v.getting.when.title": "When to come",
